			<div class="content" id="post-content-4823882">
									

<p>Can't give you a green light but I can give you some constructive criticism. This is SCP sounds intriguing but it does kind of sound similar to something else I may have read.<br />
A couple of questions you might ask yourself is</p>
<ol>
<li>how is the SCP ( the safe) stored or contained?</li>
<li>3 hours seems a bit long for someone to stare at something, what makes the SCP force people to observe it for 3 hours cumulatively in the first place( ie what makes them come back) ?</li>
<li>what is the origin of the the safe?</li>
<li>Is the safe man made or otherworldly ?</li>
<li>can the safe be x-rayed or anything along those lines to find out what is inside?</li>
<li>How much does it weigh?</li>
<li>How long before victims turn into the sub entities?</li>
<li>Can you observe the safe using a camera at 10m for 3 hours cumulatively without turning into a sub entity?</li>
<li>Can it kill/hurt you without the SCP sub entities?</li>
</ol>
<p>Im a first time time SCP writer too so I don't know everything.<br />
Here are some free name ideas for your SCP, Isolated Safe, Termination Safe, Safe?, The deviant box, The ?, The box without a key, Denied entry, The metal door to something.</p>

